sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Warp SQL server
  C->>S: PATCH /warp/v1/sessions/{id} {"options": {"autocommit": false}}
  S-->>C: 200 (a transaction is open)
  C->>S: POST …/statements INSERT …
  S-->>C: 201 succeeded
  C->>S: GET /warp/v1/sessions/{id}
  S-->>C: 200 "transaction": "open"
  alt keep it
    C->>S: POST /warp/v1/sessions/{id}/commit
  else drop it
    C->>S: POST /warp/v1/sessions/{id}/rollback
  end
  S-->>C: 204, and the next statement starts a new transaction
